  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 430074f4a7b53dd4796d71325b7b59c6, type: 3}
  m_Name: act2_summary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: act2_summary
  title: "\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5E55 \xB7 \u5362\u5361\u7B49\u5F85\u539F\u4EF6"
  context: "2026-11-02 返回改稿；见 doc/performance-edit。"
  testOnly: 0
  initialVisitor: {fileID: 0}
  arrivalSound: {fileID: 0}
  closeShutterOnComplete: 1
  arrivalDelay: 0.1
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "左手手套，巴尔托洛把委托换档的人记下来了。公爵的委托写过，替米兰代领材料的卡拉法他左手戴紫手套。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "这个叫卡拉法的绝对和这件事情有关，十有八九他已经在这里待了有一阵子了……"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "如果能调到这个“原件”，应该能确定这两件事情的联系。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "如果这个换档记录指向了请我核验的军令，那米兰人所用的手段就很明确了：造了假的文件，然后让师傅签字作保。"
